Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: fix multiple set-option commands in keybinding
 sequences

> This PR was prepared with a coding agent (Mistral Vibe)

Adds ConfigEvent::UpdateField variant to allow updating individual
config
fields instead of replacing the entire config. This fixes the issue
where
multiple :set-option commands in a keybinding sequence would only apply
the last option, as each command was reading the same initial config
state and sending full config replacements.

Modified set_option and toggle_option commands to use UpdateField, and
added handling in application.rs.

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
